WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 3.3 · Structure, Governance & Accountability
Governance structures by legal form

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Know which body decides, which advises, and how each is held to account.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Separate governance (direction, oversight) from management (daily running).

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Mix skills, independence and clear terms of office.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Write down which groups decide and which only advise.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Vanita: 140 members elect a committee of nine; manager Meera runs daily work and reports to the committee.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You describe your governing body, advisory voices and document checks.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
